This is an unofficial Horizon port of portions of Charm and Strange, originally created by Sven Hjól. It contains a mix of new and old features that I felt were appropriate for the modern version of minecraft. This mod is brand new and has not had any compatibility tested with other mods. AI assistance was used in the creation of this mod.

Charm: https://github.com/svenhjol/CharmLegacy
Strange: https://github.com/svenhjol/Strange

